[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10501.19, "timestamp": "02:55:01", "text": "各位，你们得去问版主。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10503.03, "timestamp": "02:55:03", "text": "然后，他们有版主必须给出"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10506.63, "timestamp": "02:55:06", "text": "邀请链接之类的东西给你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10509.67, "timestamp": "02:55:09", "text": "所以，不知怎么的，就像某种技术模式一样，我可以做到。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10526.309, "timestamp": "02:55:26", "text": "我们真的跑题了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10536.2, "timestamp": "02:55:36", "text": "色度偏移。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10547.91, "timestamp": "02:55:47", "text": "[音乐]"}]